@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/classSessions
@adminToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjEsInJvbGUiOiJBRE1JTiIsImlhdCI6MTc5MjExODg0MiwiZXhwIjoxNzkyMjA1MjQyfQ.P7mlHEfRpJoqua3rcMkVjETqB7qeXkSaO3hlqJjhuTY

### 1. Obtener todas las sesiones de clases (Público autenticado: Admin, Instructor, Socio)
GET {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. Obtener una sesión por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3. Crear una sesión individual
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "classScheduleId": 1,
  "instructorId": 1,
  "date": "2026-11-02",
  "startTime": "10:00",
  "status": "SCHEDULED"
}

### 4. Crear una serie recurrente SEMANAL (Lunes, Miércoles, Viernes)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "classScheduleId": 1,
  "instructorId": 1,
  "date": "2026-12-07",
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "recurrence": {
    "frequency": "WEEKLY",
    "daysOfWeek": [1, 3, 5],
    "endDate": "2026-12-30"
  }
}

### 5. Consultar reservas confirmadas afectadas antes de editar/eliminar (scope: this / following / all)
GET {{baseUrl}}/1/affected-bookings?scope=all
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. Actualizar sesión puntual con alcance 'this' (Conserva pertenencia a la serie)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "startTime": "11:30",
  "instructorId": 1,
  "scope": "this"
}

### 7. Actualizar serie con alcance 'following' (Corta y crea nueva serie para futuras)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "startTime": "15:00",
  "instructorId": 2,
  "scope": "following"
}

### 8. Actualizar serie con alcance 'all' (Todas las futuras >= hoy)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "startTime": "08:00",
  "instructorId": 1,
  "scope": "all"
}

### 9. Cancelar sesión/serie con alcance (Cancela sesiones y reservas confirmadas)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/2/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "scope": "following"
}

### 10. Eliminar sesión/serie con alcance (Soft-delete y cancelación de reservas)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/2?scope=this
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 11. Obtener sesiones por instructor
GET {{baseUrl}}/instructor/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 12. Obtener sesiones por tipo de clase
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
